; The primitive is authored as a handheld lies (card edge +Z); turned half round about
; Y so the card edge leads into a slot along -Z, as a PlayStation card's does. Shifted
; so 28 mm goes in (a PS1 card's depth), the hinge seam just outside the slot, and the
; 7.5 mm base centred on the slot's axis with the lid standing above it.
[node name="Model" parent="." instance=ExtResource("3_model")]
transform = Transform3D(-1, 0, 0, 0, 1, 0, 0, 0, -1, 0, 0.003, 0.004)

